# Governance Baseline

Mandatory:
- Canonical governance lives in docs/governance/cursor.
- Skills and agents only. Do not create .cursor/commands.
- Do not use slash-style invocation notation in docs, rules, skills, or agents.
- Keep plan files in .cursor/plans and keep status synchronized with real progress.
- Use AGENTS.md as operational index for roles and quality gates.

VCS policy:
- Default is GitLab-first with glab.
- Exception: web/your-github-project uses GitHub with gh.
